# Eval fixtures are content-addressed: `<name>.labels.json` stores a sha256 of
# `<name>.input.json`, and a mismatch is treated as stale labels. If git rewrites line
# endings on checkout, that hash changes and the non-regression gate fails on a fresh
# clone. Pin them to LF on every platform so the committed sha is the sha everyone sees.
tests/eval/fixtures/**/*.json -text eol=lf
